# Go api

- Thin door only: validate JSON, rate limit, forward to compute, map 502/504/429.
- No Redis, no PII detectors, no mask logic in `api/`.
- Stack: `net/http` + chi middleware; clone `DefaultTransport`;
  `MaxIdleConnsPerHost ≥ 32`; default RPS target 1500.
- Logs: never log `payload` / mask / original — only `payload_id`, status, duration.
- No comments in code. `gofmt` + `go vet` before done.
- Ownership: write only `api/**` (track A). See `docs/agents/OWNERSHIP.md`.
